# Copy this file to Config/AppStoreConnectAPI.env (gitignored) and fill in real values.
#
# This is a *read-oriented* App Store Connect API key ("App Manager" role), separate from the
# In-App Purchase key that Replit owns exclusively. Its purpose is checking build/TestFlight
# processing state, dSYM/PostHog-adjacent release info, and app metadata without going through
# the App Store Connect UI by hand.
#
# Generate one at App Store Connect -> Users and Access -> Integrations -> App Store Connect API
# (the "App Store Connect API" tab, not "In-App Purchase" — those are different key categories
# even though they share one Issuer ID per team). Role: App Manager. Download the .p8 once.
#
# The private key file itself does NOT live in this repo, even gitignored. Keep it at the
# standard location Apple's own tooling looks for:
#   ~/.appstoreconnect/private_keys/AuthKey_<KEY_ID>.p8   (chmod 600, directory chmod 700)
#
# This file only records the non-secret identifiers needed to build the JWT.

APPLE_ASC_KEY_ID =
APPLE_ASC_ISSUER_ID =
APPLE_ASC_KEY_PATH =
